# 9 · Troubleshooting from here

| symptom | look at |
|---|---|
| a step died | the newest log (cell below); the first ✖ line is the cause |
| dbt gate failed | `scripts/dev/dbt_failures.sh` → failing node + compiled SQL path; open the SQL and run it in the BigQuery console |
| walk returns 0 nodes | account cannot see the root (5.1), or the root id in `context/cards/library.yaml` |
| HubSpot 401 / wrong portal | 5.1 and the clinic (4.3): CRLF, placeholder, prod portal |
| "project not found" from gcloud | CRLF in `.env` → `env_clinic.sh --fix` |
| `\r: command not found` | CRLF checkout → A3 / B3 |
| scripts fine in WSL but not from Git Bash | you are on Windows; every command in this notebook already targets Ubuntu |
| Sudo is disabled on this machine | Windows `sudo.exe` — run the bootstrap inside Ubuntu (A4) |

#!pwsh

Invoke-Ubuntu 'scripts/dev/last_log.sh 40'

#!pwsh

Invoke-Ubuntu 'scripts/dev/dbt_failures.sh'

#!pwsh

Invoke-Ubuntu 'scripts/run_pass1.sh status'

